WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,220
Where did my brother go?

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,420
Could it be that he was really picked up by his ancestors?

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,540
I will keep looking

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:11,680
If you are alive, you want to see someone. If you are dead, you want to see the corpse. Report it to Your Majesty.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,320
The non-general beheaded the barbarian commander

6
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,760
The Hu people's 800,000-strong army collapsed and rewarded

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,920
Silence prohibits border sealing and guarding driving

8
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,590
Such a reward is really unfair

9
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:23,230
You set up a great border attack

10
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:24,910
Guarding the border and experiencing his merits

11
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:25,950
Attack no one can hit

12
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,590
Why don’t we get the respect we deserve?

13
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,110
It is not my righteousness to be granted the title of Marquis

14
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,510
Then what are you planning?

15
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,450
For peace of mind

16
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,060
The old general guarded the border for fifty years

17
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:38,930
Have you achieved numerous military exploits and become a marquis?

18
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,140
He doesn't care

19
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:49,320
What do I care about Horu

20
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,840
How old are you?

21
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,840
Not married yet

22
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,400
Mom wants to hold a grandson

23
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,760
you don't think about yourself

24
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:58,660
You also have to think about the Chen family. Mom, I’m all following you.

25
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:12,220
If that thing

26
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:14,020
My family will be spoiled for generations to come

27
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:17,100
Unfortunately not

28
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,120
Ziyimen is gone

29
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:20,740
The enemy has also died of old age

30
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,420
There is nothing to worry about anymore

31
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:28,090
Said mother has dreamed about it several times

32
00:01:28,370 --> 00:01:29,770
She sits on the crane

33
00:01:29,770 --> 00:01:31,570
Beloved wife, wedding bride

34
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:35,560
She is busy, the immortal is busy, so busy, so busy

35
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,960
promising
